      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790928905828,
      "created": 1790928740479,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IN circular dependency, there will be a loop\nby which there will be a exception for beqn\ncreation. as Ioc Container will get confuse\nwhich bean should create first. \nSO AVOID THIS, THIS IS CODE ARCHI.\nPROBLEM",
      "fontSize": 36,
